WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sheledzani ndima zwavhuḓi ni sa athu u fukedza nga mulch.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Phaḓaladzani mahatsi o omaho kana mulch khulwane nṱha ha mavu.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Mulch khulwane i vhe 5 u swika 10 cm. Mahatsi o remiwaho a vhe tshiṱaṱo tshisekene.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Siyani hu ḓo nga 5 cm u mona thanda dza miroho uri dzi ome.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Mvula i dzhena mavuni o fukedzwaho. Mulch i ita uri mavu a dzule o thaba.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Engedzani mulch musi i tshi vhola. Siyani tshikhala u mona thanda.
